{"channelId":"UCUaL2dlmPpRlpMIE0mth3ow","row":["Quakertown Veterinary Clinic",6,"Quakertown Veterinary Clinic provides both routine and 24-hour emergency care services to the tri-county area surrounding Quakertown, Pennsylvania.\n\nIt is our mission to provide compassionate quality care for our patients and the owners who love them.\n\nFounded in the early 1900's, Quakertown Veterinary Clinic has expanded to include emergency and general care for companion animals, exotics, equine and farm animals, as well as boarding and grooming, laboratory and other services.\n\nWe are proud to be an accredited member of the American Animal Hospital Association, meeting its high standards for excellence in veterinary care. Only 14% of the small animal veterinary facilities in North America can claim this distinction!","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUaL2dlmPpRlpMIE0mth3ow","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUaL2dlmPpRlpMIE0mth3ow","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:03.276Z","channelId":"UCUaL2dlmPpRlpMIE0mth3ow","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"b69e11d796e69414840edc758bc0723516daefbb32fc02e19989001dd6b9ffa4","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"0c427aac074d8aa99b587f42239effec4917193d93c6e980920cb42aaf7e0203"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUaL2dlmPpRlpMIE0mth3ow","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:07:29.132Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUaL2dlmPpRlpMIE0mth3ow","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":6,"raw":"6 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUaL2dlmPpRlpMIE0mth3ow","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:03.276Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[{"url":"https://www.quakertownvetclinic.com/hours-contact/","hasForm":true,"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:44:08.835Z"}],"matchedKeywords":["veterinary"],"relevantKeywords":["veterinary"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veteri